-> Test: persistence organelle — handler types and return values
link euglena/src/organelles/persistence

-> Save returns ACK
emit Save { key = "color", value = "blue" } to this get ack
assert ack._class = "ACK"
assert ack.source = "persistence"

-> Load returns LoadResult
emit Load { key = "color" } to this get result
assert result._class = "LoadResult"
assert result.key = "color"
